आउटपुट लेख: ['Test object'], नयाँ-पङ्क्ति.
>> greeter := वस्तु नयाँ.
greeter जब: ['name:'] गर: { :नाम
	आफ्नो xname := नाम. 
}.
greeter जब: ['greet'] गर: {
	आउटपुट लेख: ['Hello '] + आफ्नो xname, नयाँ-पङ्क्ति.
}.
greeter name: ['Sherlock'].
greeter save-as: ['/tmp/a.bin'].
greeter save-as: ['/tmp/b.bin'].
आउटपुट लेख: ['========== RELOADING SNAP:'], नयाँ-पङ्क्ति.
>> b := वस्तु load-from: ['/tmp/a.bin'].
>> c := वस्तु load-from: ['/tmp/b.bin'].
b greet.
b name: ['Watson'], greet.
c name: ['Moriarty'], greet.
